  "body": "Bring the family, welcome the guests and make the most of coastal living. With sea views, five bedrooms and a flexible layout across two levels, this generous Torbay home offers space to come together and room to enjoy your own retreat.\r\n\r\nThe main living area connects with the dining space and designer kitchen, creating a social heart for everyday life. From busy school mornings to weekend dinners with friends, the open-plan setting keeps everyone connected while giving you plenty of room to entertain.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a second lounge opens onto a deck, providing another inviting place to unwind. Enjoy a morning coffee, settle in with a book or give the children a space of their own. Sea views add to the appeal, bringing a coastal backdrop to a home designed to accommodate more than one family routine.\r\n\r\nFive bedrooms offer options for growing families and households sharing with relatives. The ground-floor bedroom with an adjoining bathroom provides useful separation for guests or extended family, while four bedrooms upstairs include two with ensuites. With four bathrooms and an additional separate toilet throughout the home, busy mornings become that much easier.\r\n\r\nA separate laundry and double garage add everyday convenience, completing a layout that balances shared living with personal space.\r\n\r\nBeyond the front door, enjoy the lifestyle that makes Torbay so appealing. Torbay Village offers local cafés and shops, while Waiake Beach and Long Bay provide settings for swimming, seaside afternoons and coastal walks. Further shopping and dining options await in Browns Bay, with Albany's larger retail centres within the wider North Shore area.\r\n\r\nWhether you need room for teenagers, space for visiting family or a home that can adapt as your household grows, this property deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing or join us at the next open home.",
